anti_cheese = "Stage 1 needs the XOR relation: flip exactly the beads where the letter and the wanted letter differ; the key is never shown. Stage 3: dial turns are free on purpose because the lesson is the scoring function: the gauge is the same English score the solvers use, and 256 keys is exactly where brute force plus a scorer is the right tool. Keys 65-250 always set bit 6 or 7, so no key merely flips letter case (0x20) and no wrong key reads as English by accident."
